---
---

<section id="features" class="border-t border-slate-700/70 py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5">
    <div class="mb-16 max-w-3xl reveal-on-scroll">
      <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-medium text-primary-400">Features</p>
      <h2 class="mb-6 font-heading text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-white md:text-5xl">
        Everything you need, <br/><span class="text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500">nothing you don't.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-400">
        A focused blog and notes setup with fast pages, simple content, and room to grow.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-px overflow-hidden border border-slate-700/70 bg-slate-700/70 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="bg-[#0e141b] p-8 reveal-on-scroll">
        <p class="mb-8 font-mono text-sm text-primary-400">01</p>
        <h3 class="mb-4 font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white">Fast Astro Pages</h3>
        <p class="mb-8 leading-7 text-slate-400">
          Built on Astro's islands architecture, the site ships very little JavaScript by default so the reading experience stays quick.
        </p>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-primary-500 bg-[#121b25] p-4 font-mono text-sm text-primary-300">
          <code>pnpm dev</code>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-[#0e141b] p-8 reveal-on-scroll" style="transition-delay: 75ms;">
        <p class="mb-8 font-mono text-sm text-primary-400">02</p>
        <h3 class="mb-4 font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white">Writing First</h3>
        <p class="leading-7 text-slate-400">
          Designed around posts, notes, and project updates so the content stays easy to scan and maintain.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-[#0e141b] p-8 reveal-on-scroll" style="transition-delay: 150ms;">
        <p class="mb-8 font-mono text-sm text-primary-400">03</p>
        <h3 class="mb-4 font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white">Tailwind v4 Native</h3>
        <p class="leading-7 text-slate-400">
          Built with the latest version of Tailwind CSS. Customize typography and color from a single config file.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-[#0e141b] p-8 reveal-on-scroll" style="transition-delay: 225ms;">
        <p class="mb-8 font-mono text-sm text-primary-400">04</p>
        <h3 class="mb-4 font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white">MDX Friendly</h3>
        <p class="leading-7 text-slate-400">
          Write posts and notes in Markdown or MDX and mix in components when a page needs more structure.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
